      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "My world (Tunnel Space) is suffering from 2D audio issues a lot after the Audio rework. Volume curve is not doing anything.\n\nI just confirmed that the issue is still present on the latest SDK\nSDK: 2019.09.18.12.05\nVRChat: 864\n\nTest world ID using stream player (my particular issue): wrld_92f1a794-a365-41d6-ad01-ec8b540f7183\n\nAs described in the world - the sounds should get louder as you cross the divider line in the test world, but it doesn't. The screenshot of the settings is present in the world, but i'm attaching it here too.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
